Subject: [#94-11-43] Other uses of Zen Enlightenment / Consciouness Upload 

Star Trek : The Next Generation introduced, among other stimulating entities,
the Borgs. 

The Borgs have achieved a sophisticated level of interface between humans 
and machines. These are truly supposed to be cyborgs. 

The Borgs lack individuality. A single Borg unit can function 
meaningfully only in the beehive which comprises other borgs. They have a 
collective consciousness. The borg units think together, their primordial 
thoughts are shared amongst the other units, as must be their higher 
levels of reasoning (?...?)

I propose that we talk a little about these borgs. We have before us 
something concrete. Most of us might have seen the borg episodes of Star 
Trek. Let us talk about our personal first thoughts on the Borgs. 


